/* 通用的"整屏滚动列表"样式：首页/模拟考试列表/错题本列表都是这个骨架 —
   顶部横幅图 + section 标题 + 一组 paper-card。 */

.home-scroll {
  height: 100vh;
  padding: calc(12rpx + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 40rpx 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.hero-banner {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 48rpx;
  display: block;
  margin: 12rpx 0 40rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 20rpx 56rpx -28rpx rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.18);
}

.section-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin: 52rpx 4rpx 24rpx;
}

.section-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 33rpx;
  letter-spacing: -0.3rpx;
  color: var(--text-0);
}

.section-count {
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "SF Mono", monospace;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--text-2);
}

.paper-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20rpx;
}

.paper-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 28rpx;
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 36rpx;
  padding: 28rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 8rpx 28rpx -16rpx rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.08);
}

.paper-card.active {
  border-color: rgba(11, 107, 99, 0.35);
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(11, 107, 99, 0.06), rgba(207, 234, 230, 0.03));
}

.paper-card.disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.paper-icon {
  height: 84rpx;
  min-width: 168rpx;
  padding: 0 24rpx;
  border-radius: 24rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--surface-2);
  border: 1rpx solid var(--border);
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "SF Mono", monospace;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  letter-spacing: -0.4rpx;
  color: var(--text-1);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.paper-card.active .paper-icon {
  background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--green), var(--green-bright));
  box-shadow: 0 12rpx 28rpx -12rpx rgba(11, 107, 99, 0.5);
  color: #fff;
  border-color: transparent;
}

.paper-mid {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.paper-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 29rpx;
  letter-spacing: -0.2rpx;
  color: var(--text-0);
}

.paper-sub {
  font-size: 23rpx;
  color: var(--text-1);
  margin-top: 6rpx;
}

.paper-progress {
  height: 8rpx;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  background: rgba(20, 24, 33, 0.07);
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.paper-progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), var(--green-bright));
}

.paper-right {
  text-align: right;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.paper-frac {
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono", "SF Mono", monospace;
  font-size: 25rpx;
  color: var(--text-1);
}

.paper-arrow {
  color: var(--text-2);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  margin-top: 12rpx;
}

.empty-state {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 120rpx 40rpx;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 20rpx;
}
